WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.690 --> 00:01:36.040
Dosukoi,
The Love Filled School Festival

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:42.530
No more…

00:01:42.530 --> 00:01:46.660
Geez, how pathetic, it seems girls just don't have enough spirit.

00:01:46.660 --> 00:01:49.410
Stop insulting girls everyday!

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:50.710
Come on, one more.

00:01:53.210 --> 00:01:55.630
S-Sorry, Shii-chan.

00:01:55.630 --> 00:02:04.140
It-It's okay, I'll believe in you… this is all for you.

00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:10.520
Again!

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.640
Shii-chan, sorry again…

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.190
Come on stand, one more.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:21.240
You know… how is this going to help in a fight against a god?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:22.190
What was that?

00:02:22.650 --> 00:02:28.740
Why don't you just teach me some mysterious power that makes me amazingly strong.

00:02:28.740 --> 00:02:30.290
Don't fight.

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:34.460
If anything happens with them, don't fight, run.

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:37.080
W-Why?!

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.500
All I'm teaching you at the moment is Ukemi.

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:43.880
So you might be able to avoid some damage, or find a chance to escape.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:48.930
What! To not fight and run, how is that following the code of the samurai?!

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:50.510
When did you become a samurai?

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:54.060
If I'm not around, don't try to use a power you can't control.

00:02:54.770 --> 00:02:56.150
Even if you do, you stand no chance of winning.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:58.900
T-That's not true!

00:02:58.900 --> 00:03:01.440
Last time I got the snobby glasses guy!

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:03.280
That was just that guy…

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:06.860
You let your guard down, nii-san.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.160
I was just one step away.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:14.750
If that cat hadn't appeared, I would have defeated them.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:22.460
You rushed it too much, nii-san.

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.880
I know, you don't have to tell me.

00:03:26.590 --> 00:03:31.970
However, maybe we were mistaken to try and attack from the front.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.140
We better change the way we do things this time.

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:39.730
Kirika, you were getting along quite well with that amateur goddess, correct?

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:40.520
Eh?

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:44.320
Get close to the amateur goddess.

00:03:44.860 --> 00:03:46.200
Look for an opening.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.950
Get her while she's being deceived?

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:55.870
Kirio-chan. Kirika-chan.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.840
If possible, get rid of her before she can transform.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:01.750
I can't…

00:04:02.380 --> 00:04:04.260
We don't have the time to choose a different method.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:07.760
Even if you won't get rid of her, stealing the ring will be more than enough, right?

00:04:08.510 --> 00:04:09.760
I'll leave that to you.

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:35.290
Geez, this is boring and pointless.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:37.790
That's not true.

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.830
You're young, but I'm sure you understand.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.770
It's a better idea not to get into a fight you can't win…

00:04:44.770 --> 00:04:49.340
But then… he doesn't have to say I'm pathetic, and have no spirit!

00:04:49.340 --> 00:04:51.750
And all that while he's giving me rough Spartan training.

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.890
"Don't fight! Run!" Who's the one without any spirit?!

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:57.480
Here, Karin-chan.

00:04:58.890 --> 00:05:01.060
Good work.

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.070
Ah, thanks, Himeka-chan.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:07.990
This is a drink I made.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:13.200
It's got honey, lemon, and soy sauce in it.

00:05:14.030 --> 00:05:15.910
It'll make you energetic.

00:05:15.910 --> 00:05:19.410
Ah, that's good, I've been out of energy all day.

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:26.050
I'm sorry.

00:05:27.420 --> 00:05:33.470
You're having to go through all this for me.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:36.100
What are you talking about, Himeka-chan?

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:40.890
Energy restored!

00:05:40.890 --> 00:05:45.020
Need to get strong quickly, so I can protect Himeka-chan properly.

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:47.860
Karin-chan… I'm sorry.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:54.870
Don't be, I'm going to get really strong, and hit that "girl this, girl that" Kazune-kun!

00:05:54.870 --> 00:05:56.830
You hear that, Kujyou Kazune!

00:05:58.700 --> 00:06:01.370
Karin-chan's on fire.

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:09.380
Kazune-chan has his strict parts, but he is kind.

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:12.510
Eh? Really?

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:17.720
And… it's easy to make Kazune-chan cry.

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:20.100
Eh… how?

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:24.150
You just need to have bugs with you.

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:28.570
No matter how you look at it… that's unfair.

00:06:30.230 --> 00:06:33.530
I'm sensing a dark surge coming from Karin-chan.

00:06:34.610 --> 00:06:38.780
You two, breakfast has been prepared.

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:40.540
Okay!!!

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:50.420
I'm looking forward to it. The school festival makes school seem like a different place than usual.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:53.760
A different place than usual, huh?

00:06:55.340 --> 00:07:00.390
In that different than usual atmosphere, me and Kirika-senpai can get together!

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:08.980
Karin-chan!

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:13.150
Geez, that Ukemi I just taught you really isn't getting into your head, is it?

00:07:13.150 --> 00:07:14.400
Kazune-chan!

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:19.450
W-Well, the bird just flew off in a weird direction.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.830
If you don't hurry, we're going to be late.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.540
I can't breathe.

00:07:27.540 --> 00:07:33.210
That guy! You'll never be like Kirika-senpai.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.420
Kirika-senpai?

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:42.220
Yeah, he's so kind, and cool, and always cheers me up when I'm down.

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:45.520
Is it someone you admire?

00:07:46.310 --> 00:07:49.360
I'm sure you'll think he's amazing too!

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:53.030
Although, then you'll be my rival…

00:07:53.650 --> 00:07:54.650
Just kidding!

00:07:55.610 --> 00:07:59.120
I'm fine.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:07:59.870
Huh?

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:05.830
There is already someone I like.

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:10.250
Who could it be?

00:08:12.090 --> 00:08:14.210
Okay, starting with the first matter.

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:24.020
Okay then, I think we should pick from these, please raise your hands.

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:26.480
Play

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:26.480
Ghost house

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:26.480
Coffee shop

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:26.480
Food cart

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:26.480
Flea market

00:08:24.350 --> 00:08:26.480
Firstly, who wants to do a play?

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.480
A play?

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:42.740
Oh, Kirika-senpai, wherefore art though Kirika-senpai?

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:46.750
That is because I'm in a higher grade than you.

00:08:46.750 --> 00:08:50.580
Ah, it is difficult for different grades to love one another.

00:08:51.280 --> 00:08:53.090
It does not matter that we are in different grades.

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:57.380
Karin, I love you.

00:08:58.010 --> 00:09:01.510
Kirika-senpai!!!

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:05.390
Abstain!

00:09:12.270 --> 00:09:14.900
Alright then, who wants a ghost house?

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.820
A ghost house?

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:23.570
Ah! Kirika-senpai I'm scared!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:27.450
Don't worry, I will protect you.

00:09:29.120 --> 00:09:34.490
Vengeful Spirit…

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:37.420
Ah! Kirika-senpai!..

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:41.050
Vengeful Spi-

00:09:41.050 --> 00:09:42.510
Evil begone!

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:45.470
Bug!

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:47.720
Are you alright?

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:53.060
Yes, Kirika-senpai, you're a-ma-zing!

00:09:57.940 --> 00:10:01.450
Okay, next are the people who want a coffee shop?

00:10:02.150 --> 00:10:03.950
A coffee shop?

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:13.210
As expected, the coffee Karin-chan pours is by far the most delicious.

00:10:14.580 --> 00:10:16.090
Really?

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:24.640
However, the real number one… is y-o-u.

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:27.940
Nooo!

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:30.470
No-no…

00:10:30.890 --> 00:10:32.230
Karin-chan!

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:32.980
Huh?

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.570
Karin-chan, what's "Nooo"?

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:39.610
I'm sorry…

00:10:49.990 --> 00:10:52.910
The school festival will become another chance.

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:57.790
There is no doubt that the amateur goddess will be in a festival mood.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:02.170
Take that opportunity, and do it.

00:11:04.680 --> 00:11:05.840
Understood.

00:11:11.210 --> 00:11:12.200
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:15.740
I am God!

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:20.700
You moron.

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:20.700
It's a croquette!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.570
Okay, attention!

00:11:23.190 --> 00:11:28.370
In yesterday's homeroom, we decided to do a costume coffee shop.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.830
Today, we'll determine the costumes with a lottery.

00:11:33.160 --> 00:11:36.620
We borrowed a lot of costumes from the Drama Club.

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:41.420
There are even cute ones like this!

00:11:42.000 --> 00:11:45.010
Alright then, please come and line up to pick one out of the lottery.

00:11:47.090 --> 00:11:48.430
A lottery?

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:55.180
In order to turn that into a reality, I have to get that cute one, no matter what!

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:01.610
She's putting a lot of power into this…

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:07.700
Come forth.

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:15.000
In my right hand now, my mini-goddess powers are flaring!

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.390
I've got it!!!

00:12:40.980 --> 00:12:45.070
Farewell, my lovey-dovey school festival.

00:12:51.780 --> 00:12:52.700
Karin-chan.

00:12:54.080 --> 00:12:55.790
Yes, Yuki-kun?

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:59.210
Well… I have a favor to ask…

00:12:59.920 --> 00:13:02.670
Y-Yuki-kun, did you get that?!

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.960
Yeah… and as you can expect, it's kinda…

00:13:06.460 --> 00:13:08.300
Well, obviously…

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.390
So, do you want to swap?

00:13:11.720 --> 00:13:13.890
Your costume for mine.

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:15.310
Really?

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.770
Really-really?

00:13:17.140 --> 00:13:18.180
You don't mind?

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:19.770
It's a panda!

00:13:20.350 --> 00:13:22.020
Please, let me be a panda.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:26.780
Welcome back, my lovey-dovey school festival!

00:13:29.110 --> 00:13:31.780
Ah! Karin-chan, you're so cute!

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.670
When I'm actually wearing it, it's kind of embarrassing.

00:13:42.290 --> 00:13:44.250
I got this…

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:45.960
Ah, that's…

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:47.260
Miyon!

00:13:47.310 --> 00:13:52.390
Eh, I got the same as Yuki! How embarrassing!

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:53.590
It'll be fun!

00:13:55.300 --> 00:13:57.220
Kujyou-kun!

00:13:57.640 --> 00:13:58.520
What? What?

00:13:58.520 --> 00:13:59.640
Stop being so persistent!

00:14:00.940 --> 00:14:02.600
Try this one!

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:05.020
Try this, and this, and this!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.020
Like I'd wear those!

00:14:06.020 --> 00:14:07.530
You'll look amazing!

00:14:07.530 --> 00:14:08.940
We had costumes like those?

00:14:09.360 --> 00:14:12.450
They were probably all personally made.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.120
That's definitely it.

00:14:14.700 --> 00:14:17.200
Karin-chan, look!

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:20.000
Dosukoi!

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:24.960
Himeka-chan! What in the world is that?!

00:14:24.960 --> 00:14:27.670
A sumo wrestler…

00:14:28.000 --> 00:14:30.170
kochan desu…

00:14:30.170 --> 00:14:33.260
Y-Yeah… I can see that, but…

00:14:33.260 --> 00:14:36.550
I've always wanted to try it once!

00:14:36.550 --> 00:14:41.810
I-I see, well, as long as you like it, all is good.

00:14:41.810 --> 00:14:43.980
Dosukoi!

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:50.480
A-Anyway, now that I've got these clothes, all I need to do is show them to Kirika-senpai!

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:08.750
The school festival will become another chance.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:15.970
It's finally the school festival, I'm sure she's looking forward to it…

00:15:20.140 --> 00:15:21.470
Kirika-senpai!

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:21.890
Yes?

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:24.600
Karin-chan…

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:27.900
Ah… sorry…

00:15:28.690 --> 00:15:30.070
Am I interrupting something?

00:15:31.730 --> 00:15:33.900
No, it's fine.

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:35.450
What do you need?

00:15:35.860 --> 00:15:40.950
Uh… it's about the school festival… but… uh…

00:15:42.370 --> 00:15:45.160
Our class is doing a coffee shop!

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:49.670
And so… uh…

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.750
I have to say it!

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:53.920
I have to be brave!

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:58.470
I want you to come to it, Kirika-senpai!

00:16:02.430 --> 00:16:09.150
Uh… well… you listened to my problems, so I want to thank you…

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.730
So if you have time available… and it's okay…

00:16:15.990 --> 00:16:18.700
B-But if it's causing you trouble then…

00:16:19.200 --> 00:16:20.280
I'd be happy to.

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:21.330
Eh?!

00:16:24.700 --> 00:16:26.000
I'll definitely be there.

00:16:26.460 --> 00:16:28.620
Ah… really?

00:16:31.210 --> 00:16:32.040
It's a promise.

00:16:33.590 --> 00:16:34.090
Yes.

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:40.260
Thank you very much.

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:43.720
From me as well, thank you for the invitation.

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:46.100
W-Well then, excuse me.

00:16:52.690 --> 00:16:55.110
This is the "chance", right?

00:16:57.240 --> 00:16:58.860
I-am-home!

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:02.280
Himeka-chan! Guess what, guess what!

00:17:02.280 --> 00:17:04.240
Huh? Where's Himeka-chan?

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:05.750
No idea.

00:17:05.750 --> 00:17:09.750
Waa~, and I wanted to report my great happiness.

00:17:09.750 --> 00:17:11.210
Report your happiness?

00:17:12.290 --> 00:17:14.960
Yeah, yeah! He said he'd come!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:15.960
To what?

00:17:15.960 --> 00:17:17.880
The coffee shop at the school festival.

00:17:18.340 --> 00:17:19.220
Ah, who?

00:17:19.630 --> 00:17:22.550
Do you know, do you know… Kirika-senpai!

00:17:23.350 --> 00:17:26.810
I was so nervous when I invited him!

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:31.060
And then, and then, I was super happy! We even made a pinky promise!

00:17:31.690 --> 00:17:33.020
Are you an idiot?

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:33.310
Eh?

00:17:34.270 --> 00:17:36.690
Stay away from Karasuma Kirika.

00:17:39.360 --> 00:17:40.540
Why?

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:41.160
Huh?

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.280
Why are you telling me things like that?!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:45.450
Huh?

00:17:45.450 --> 00:17:49.710
I hate you, Kazune-kun!

00:17:49.710 --> 00:17:51.420
Hey, wait!

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:52.920
Karin!

00:17:54.340 --> 00:17:54.920
Dammit.

00:17:55.460 --> 00:17:59.940
What! Why! He doesn't even understand my feelings!

00:17:59.940 --> 00:18:03.510
I like him! I'm in love!

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:15.980
Himeka-chan! What's the matter? Why are you here?

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:17.780
Did something happen?

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:20.700
Karin-chan…

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.360
H-Himeka-chan!

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:28.740
If there's anything I can do to help… please tell me, okay?

00:18:29.870 --> 00:18:31.160
Weird.

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:32.000
Huh?

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:37.340
He said it was weird.

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:41.090
When I showed him the sumo suit.

00:18:41.420 --> 00:18:43.680
Oh, that…

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:45.050
Who said that?

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:49.100
Could it be… the person you said you liked?

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:57.440
Maybe… it's better to be normal…

00:18:57.770 --> 00:19:01.780
Himeka-chan must really like this person.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.570
Just like me…

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:10.290
It's okay, Himeka-chan!

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:11.290
Eh?

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:14.710
Leave it to the mini-goddess!

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:35.730
Look, look! There's a Beautiful Boy and Girl Contest!

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:38.980
Beautiful Boy! How lovely!

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:42.820
Look, look! The Idol Kuga Jin is going to have a concert.

00:19:42.820 --> 00:19:45.570
Jin-kun, how lovely!

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:51.660
I'm expecting good news.

00:19:52.200 --> 00:19:53.750
News that I'll be satisfied with.

00:19:55.540 --> 00:19:58.750
I want to go and see the school festival.

00:19:59.380 --> 00:20:01.210
Please be patient a bit longer.

00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:07.130
Just a little more patience.

00:20:07.840 --> 00:20:09.260
Right, Kirika?

00:20:13.020 --> 00:20:14.770
Well, I'll be going.

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:19.190
Ah, Himeka-chan, you're so cute!

00:20:19.560 --> 00:20:21.210
It looks really good!

00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:22.610
It really suits you!

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:28.280
T-Thank you.

00:20:29.160 --> 00:20:32.490
But I'm sure that costume was Karin-chan's…

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:33.870
Dosukoi!

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:37.040
This is exiting! It looks good, right?

00:20:37.040 --> 00:20:39.540
I've always wanted to wear something like this!

00:20:40.210 --> 00:20:42.420
Even though you didn't want the panda?

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.670
Y-Yeah.

00:20:48.840 --> 00:20:51.510
Although… that was a really cute costume.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.850
It's perfect for Himeka-chan.

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:03.980
Himeka.

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:08.820
Eh? You changed outfits?

00:21:08.820 --> 00:21:10.530
Y-Yeah.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:13.870
That looks pretty good.

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:22.540
Good for you, Himeka-chan.

00:21:24.130 --> 00:21:27.880
I hope the person Himeka-chan likes will also like it.

00:21:29.180 --> 00:21:31.640
Ah, you're wearing that?

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:32.800
Ah, yeah.

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:36.770
It's weird.

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:40.060
Huh? What was that?

00:21:51.360 --> 00:21:53.410
K-Kirika-senpai!

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:56.870
He came! He really came! He...

00:22:01.960 --> 00:22:04.250
Karin-chan…

00:22:04.250 --> 00:22:06.170
What's wrong with her?..

00:22:06.170 --> 00:22:08.380
I can't let him see me in these clothes.

00:22:12.260 --> 00:22:13.970
Karin-chan…

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:15.930
She's going shiko…

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:21.890
He said he'd come no matter what… but I can't show him these clothes!

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:23.350
Excuse me.

00:22:26.800 --> 00:22:28.760
Is Karin-chan here?

00:22:28.960 --> 00:22:35.160
What should I do?!

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:56.000
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.530 --> 00:22:56.000
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:56.000 --> 00:23:04.360
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:56.000 --> 00:23:04.360
…with the ring shining.

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:09.780
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:04.360 --> 00:23:09.780
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:16.250
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:16.250
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:31.680
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.750 --> 00:23:31.680
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:35.140
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.680 --> 00:23:35.140
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:45.530
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:45.530
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:52.580
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.530 --> 00:23:52.580
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.580 --> 00:24:02.380
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.580 --> 00:24:02.380
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:11.090
Get ready,
Dancing School Festival

00:24:06.710 --> 00:24:08.570
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.570 --> 00:24:11.710
Get ready! Dancing School Festival!

00:24:12.090 --> 00:24:14.510
Um… I'm the heroine, right?

00:24:14.510 --> 00:24:17.090
Then… why am I in a sumo suit?

00:24:17.130 --> 00:24:18.140
Geez!
